<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cinba raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cinba raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Robert Fleming analysts Jose Costa Buck and Gonzalo Pangaro have upgraded their rating for Argentine winery Cinba to speculative buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Even though it is too early to confirm that the depressed volumes trend in prevous quarters has been reversed, Cinba's robust third-quarter should be welcomed by the market in our view,&quot; they wrote in an Aug 14 report.</p>
<p>-- &quot;... The stock has fallen by 35.4 percent since we downgraded our recommendation on Cinba from buy to hold on Feb 11, 1997,&quot; they added.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the company closed at 1.50 pesos Thursday in Buenos Aires.</p>
</text>
